.DS_Store
**/node_modules/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.auth/
**/state/
**/results/
**/baseline/
harness/lab/data/
*.log
*.tar.gz
*.zip
*.pem
*.key

companion/build/

# Machine-only history, assistant state and generated runtime artifacts.
.local/
**/.remember/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
**/weights/
harness/bridge/SoulStoneBridge*.jar
harness/bridge/source/
# Keep the matching upstream source beside its pinned binary and license.
!harness/bridge/ViaProxy-*-source.zip

# ViaProxy writes its own config and account store next to the jar it runs from.
# The tracked source config is companion/bridge/viaproxy.yml; these are runtime.
harness/*.yml
harness/bridge/*.yml
harness/saves.json
harness/bridge/saves.json
harness/viabedrock/
harness/bridge/viabedrock/
